  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Iwerne area</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "BAtlas declined to place this name, which is reported by the Ravenna Cosmographer, on a map. The directory cites Rivet 1979 and suggests a general location in the \"Iwerne area\". RENames suggests identifying this name with the Roman fort inside the indigenous hillfort at Hod Hill.",
